	('257b5626-5361-42fe-8c29-b022591aadec', 'en', 'Organisationen behöver registrering i EU:s system (PIC/OID)', 'The organisation needs to be registered in the EU''s system (PIC/OID)', '2026-09-03 21:22:47.154334+00'),
